  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Aiziraeli ariphokala Shitimu, alume ahenda udiya na achetu a Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achetu aha aalika Aiziraeli kpwenye sharee za kulavira milungu yao sadaka, nao Aiziraeli arya na achiabudu milungu ya Amoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Aiziraeli adziunga kuabudu Baali wa Peori, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiatsukirirwa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, “Gbwira hinyo atu ariolongoza atu kuhenda dzambo hiri, uaolage na uagbwadzike dzulu ya nguzo mutsi mbere zangu, ili tsukizi zangu siru ziaukire Aiziraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Musa wagomba na aamuli a Iziraeli achiaamba, “Chila mmwenga wenu ni aolage atue ariodziunga kuabudu Baali wa Peori.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli ariphokala anarira mbere za hema ra mkpwutano, Muiziraeli mmwenga wareha mchetu wa Chimidiani mwakpwe hemani mbere za Musa na kundi rosi ra Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finehasi mwana wa Eliazari, mdzukulu wa mlavyadzi-sadaka Aruni ariphoona hivi, wauka pho mkpwutanoni achendahala fumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye achimlunga yuya Muiziraeli mo hemani, achiadunga osi airi. Hiro fumo ramdunga ye Muiziraeli hadi richidunga ye mchetu ndanini. Phahi ro shaka rauswa kula kahi za Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela atu arioolagbwa ni ro shaka kala ni atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Finehasi mwana wa Eliazari, mdzukulu wa mlavyadzi-sadaka Aruni akanihenda nriche kuatsukirirwa Aiziraeli kpwa kukala iye ana wivu kpwa ajili yangu mimi, kayavumirira kuona atu anahenda dambi. Ndiyo mana siaangamizire Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo muambire kukala ninamuikira chilagane changu cha amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninaika chilagane naye kukala iye na chivyaziche andakala alavyadzi-sadaka ta kare na kare mana iye waahenda Aiziraeli apatanishwe na Mlungu kpwa wivu ariokala nao kpwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mlungu na kusavumirira kuona atu anahenda dambi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye Muiziraeli ariyeolagbwa phamwenga na yuya mchetu Mmidiani kala anaihwa Zimuri mwana wa Salu, yekala chilongozi wa mryango mmwenga kahi ya mbari ya Simioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ye mchetu Mmidiani ariyeolagbwa kala anaihwa Kozibi mwana wa Suri, yekala chilongozi wa mbari mwenga hiko Midiani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aharireni dza maadui nyo Amidiani, na muaangamize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwa sababu ya mai arigokuhenderani ariphokuchengani hiko Peori. Na kpwa sababu ya Kozibi, mwana wa chilongozi wa Midiani ariyeolagbwa wakati wa shaka ririrokuphahani ko Peori.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
